# Same, under .claude/. The masked *directories* (agents, commands, hooks,
# routines, skills, workflows, output-styles) are pre-created with a tracked .gitkeep by
# safe-claude-code so bwrap binds over them instead of leaking stubs. These two
# are files, not directories, so they can't be .gitkeep'd; ignore their launch-time stubs.
.claude/launch.json
.claude/scheduled_tasks.json


